<Layout title="For students | Kin & Campus" description="Join a young adult wellness program in Blacksburg. Keep your plan going, learn the adult parts of care, and decide who we tell.">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">For students</div><h1>A program you join for the years you are here.</h1><p class="lead">Kin &amp; Campus is a young adult wellness program in Blacksburg, built for this chapter of your life. A board-certified pediatrician who lives here keeps your plan going, sees you when you are sick, and teaches you the adult parts of care while you still have someone to ask. If you want your parents in the loop, we decide that together.</p></div>
<div class="w">
<div class="notes">
<div class="note-row"><h3>Refills</h3><p>Whatever you already take. ADHD medication, an inhaler, something for anxiety, allergies, acne. It should not lapse because you moved into a dorm, and the program is how it does not.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>When you're sick</h3><p>Write us. We already know your baseline. During the school year we can usually see you the same week, and often the same day.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>The adult parts</h3><p>How to book a visit. When to refill. When a fever is just a fever, and when it isn't. This is the year you learn that with a real doctor, not later, on your own, at forty.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>Who we tell</h3><p>At 18 the chart is yours. If you want us to call home, we write that down first. Belonging includes that agreement.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:56px">The year, on campus time</div>
<h2>When members write us.</h2>
<div class="notes">
<div class="note-row"><h3>A sick day</h3><p>A fever, a sore throat, an asthma flare. Come in if you need to be seen. The program is for the ordinary days as much as the chronic ones.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>A refill running out</h3><p>Don't wait until the bottle is empty. We keep the plan going through the semester, including the stretches when you are busy enough to forget.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>A form</h3><p>Housing, sports, travel, the immunization packet. Bring it and we'll sign what we can, as part of the year you belong to.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>After a break</h3><p>We check whether you are still taking what we prescribed, and whether it still fits. Move-in, holidays, finals, and the week you come back are part of the calendar on purpose.</p></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Join the program</a></p>
</div>
</Layout>
